    "name": "2025",
    "steam_appid": 3696710,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/0d92256c132f2483f57eaa13d2331808.avif?t=1749599884\" data-has-big width=800 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been selected to work in the <strong>Media Regulation Branch</strong>, the front lines in the fight for truth and national purity. Report to Office Building Number: 171 Room: 152 by the end of the day. Your duty? Safeguard NewMerican values, ensure only that trustworthy information reaches the public.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/8632b439f1ea8c4de81c860951552ed4.poster.avif?t=1749599884\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/8632b439f1ea8c4de81c860951552ed4.webp?t=1749599884\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=520 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As stated in your employ handbook section C page 14 under the 5th stanza of the 3rd paragraph you are to be filtering out and stamping all information the public is <i>allowed</i> to see. You are the final check to ensure NewMerica stays the perfect safe haven for all.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2025</strong> is a dystopian 2D puzzle game where you take on the role of a NewMerican media censor officer within a surveillance heavy, authoritarian society. Through the manipulation of text, redaction of sensitive content, and strategic bans of documents, you must maintain the truth of NewMerica, the world's most perfect country.\u00a0\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/17dace148ad7de00ff5eb122d9c2ef1c.poster.avif?t=1749599884\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/17dace148ad7de00ff5eb122d9c2ef1c.webp?t=1749599884\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=520 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day you are assigned a stack of the latest news articles that need approval before they are sent out to the public. By using the NewMerican Standard censorship tools you have the ability to cover up scandals, spread false information, and most importantly appease your bosses.\u00a0 <strong>Redact</strong> names. <strong>Reword</strong> events. <strong>Black out</strong> cities. <strong>Ban</strong> anything that contradicts the State\u2019s image. And whatever you do, <i>eliminate</i> all signs of the treacherous <strong>Green Party</strong> and their figurehead, the so-called \u201c<strong>Black Swan</strong>.\u201d<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/6c464ce3808910b9a171d29bab255071.poster.avif?t=1749599884\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/6c464ce3808910b9a171d29bab255071.webm?t=1749599884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/6c464ce3808910b9a171d29bab255071.mp4?t=1749599884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <strong>beware</strong>. The deeper you dig, the more inconsistencies you\u2019ll find. Hidden codes, forbidden names, and subtle signs of rebellion lurk beneath the surface. Can you suppress the truth without losing sight of it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/c685dcc37364fa570c4c9231cd66930b.avif?t=1749599884\" data-has-big width=800 height=117 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-rich puzzles</strong> where each document tells part of a larger story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-crafted articles</strong> that evolve over time to reflect your influence \u2014 or failure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching narrative influenced by <strong>your</strong> choices to obey, bend, or resist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, satirical world inspired by real-world propaganda, media control, and digital surveillance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily quotas, shifting expectations, and increasing pressure from higher-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets hidden in plain sight \u2014 if you dare to look closely</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not fall for Green Party propaganda! Do your part to benefit all of NewMerica.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/8828a07c0c4b752dba94513a6d94e95c.avif?t=1749599884\" data-has-big width=800 height=117 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/0d92256c132f2483f57eaa13d2331808.avif?t=1749599884\" data-has-big width=800 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been selected to work in the <strong>Media Regulation Branch</strong>, the front lines in the fight for truth and national purity. Report to Office Building Number: 171 Room: 152 by the end of the day. Your duty? Safeguard NewMerican values, ensure only that trustworthy information reaches the public.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/8632b439f1ea8c4de81c860951552ed4.poster.avif?t=1749599884\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/8632b439f1ea8c4de81c860951552ed4.webp?t=1749599884\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=520 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As stated in your employ handbook section C page 14 under the 5th stanza of the 3rd paragraph you are to be filtering out and stamping all information the public is <i>allowed</i> to see. You are the final check to ensure NewMerica stays the perfect safe haven for all.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2025</strong> is a dystopian 2D puzzle game where you take on the role of a NewMerican media censor officer within a surveillance heavy, authoritarian society. Through the manipulation of text, redaction of sensitive content, and strategic bans of documents, you must maintain the truth of NewMerica, the world's most perfect country.\u00a0\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/17dace148ad7de00ff5eb122d9c2ef1c.poster.avif?t=1749599884\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/17dace148ad7de00ff5eb122d9c2ef1c.webp?t=1749599884\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=520 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day you are assigned a stack of the latest news articles that need approval before they are sent out to the public. By using the NewMerican Standard censorship tools you have the ability to cover up scandals, spread false information, and most importantly appease your bosses.\u00a0 <strong>Redact</strong> names. <strong>Reword</strong> events. <strong>Black out</strong> cities. <strong>Ban</strong> anything that contradicts the State\u2019s image. And whatever you do, <i>eliminate</i> all signs of the treacherous <strong>Green Party</strong> and their figurehead, the so-called \u201c<strong>Black Swan</strong>.\u201d<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/6c464ce3808910b9a171d29bab255071.poster.avif?t=1749599884\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/6c464ce3808910b9a171d29bab255071.webm?t=1749599884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/6c464ce3808910b9a171d29bab255071.mp4?t=1749599884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <strong>beware</strong>. The deeper you dig, the more inconsistencies you\u2019ll find. Hidden codes, forbidden names, and subtle signs of rebellion lurk beneath the surface. Can you suppress the truth without losing sight of it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/c685dcc37364fa570c4c9231cd66930b.avif?t=1749599884\" data-has-big width=800 height=117 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-rich puzzles</strong> where each document tells part of a larger story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-crafted articles</strong> that evolve over time to reflect your influence \u2014 or failure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching narrative influenced by <strong>your</strong> choices to obey, bend, or resist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, satirical world inspired by real-world propaganda, media control, and digital surveillance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily quotas, shifting expectations, and increasing pressure from higher-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets hidden in plain sight \u2014 if you dare to look closely</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not fall for Green Party propaganda! Do your part to benefit all of NewMerica.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696710/extras/8828a07c0c4b752dba94513a6d94e95c.avif?t=1749599884\" data-has-big width=800 height=117 /></span></p>",
